ng", "id": "1320556889188298", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391898_1320556892521631_4203757094769070119_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VUj_tw8w3V4Q7kNvwHQFhfz&_nc_oc=Adok7yn9uCrtPtz-lcMWmUOpIXyMvn6YWhIdx2lUYJeWvmoCJU9w6_K6Qmcq9Qp4k7M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5oQs484vkh5cMj3x8-iqvf33JSR7PyRJ5BXKTxbOEeBA&oe=6A05D81E"}, "display_name": "Beauty Salon Simulator VR", "keywords": ["Beauty", "Salon", "Makeup", "Fashion", "Creative"], "long_description": "# \u2728Features **Three** Main Sections\n\n# \ud83d\udc84Makeup Section\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f\nStep into the role of a **makeup artist**, offering a wide range of **cosmetic services**. From applying **blush, eyeshadow, mascara, glitter and liner** to switching up **hair styles, brows, lashes and eye lenses**\n{1280831073127338}\n\n**coloring** hair lashes and brow, each look is yours to create. Enhance skin with a **scrub and steam** routine, experiment with **artistic markers**. Top it off with **lipstick** classic, glossy, or glitter finishes, and personalize it further with **accessories** like **glasses, lenses, or nose piercings**. Every brushstroke offers a chance to **explore your creativity**.\n\n\n# \ud83d\udc85 Nails & Pedicure Section \ud83d\udc63\nOffer clients a relaxing **manicure** and **pedicure** service by **filing** and **polishing fingernails** and **toenails**, refreshing their feet with a **scrub brush**. Take it a step further by attaching **stylish nail extensions**, giving each client a personalized look that truly stands out.\n{2095491800866025}\n\n# \ud83d\udcf8 Photography Section \ud83d\udc57\ncapture your clients' final look by letting them take **stunning photos** with a **virtual camera**, change their outfit for a unique style, and use a **green screen to switch backgrounds**. Adjust **poses and facial expressions** for the perfect shot, then **pin and store** your favorite styles on your wall of fame to celebrate your best creations.\n{631845462860833}\n\n# Early Access\nWe\u2019re planning to continuously enhancing the experience by adding more **customization options**, new **styling tools**, and a wider range of **makeup extensions**. Can't wait to hear your feedback!", "short_description": "Step into the ultimate virtual beauty salon experience! Transform your clients with a variety of makeup, pedicure tools, extensions, accessories and outfits in this creative and relaxing simulation sandbox. Customize every detail of their look, snap stunning photos, and let your imagination shine!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.keycapgames.net/privacy-policy-beauty-salon.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Keycap Games LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.keycapgames.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9277866902234028"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 12, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1595843031501426"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2062152911303341"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2752584691800245"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1584610699208555"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1109320164457495"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2344529512643377"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": 